1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,925
Your social media followers live on rented land: the platform can change the rules tomorrow. Your email list is owned land.

2
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:19,055
But consent comes first. Ask clearly, say what you will send, and make it easy to unsubscribe. Never buy lists.

3
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:29,250
WhatsApp Business gives you a profile, a catalogue, quick replies, labels for customers, and broadcast lists.

4
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:39,975
People only receive broadcasts if they saved your number. Keep messages personal and useful. Too many broadcasts, and people block you.

5
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:51,355
Write short, honest subject lines, one message, and one clear button. Split your list into segments, so each group gets what fits.

6
00:00:52,060 --> 00:01:01,485
Some emails send themselves: a welcome series, an abandoned basket reminder, a thank-you with a review request, and a win-back.

